# Glyph groups that are deliberately pixel-identical, per face.
# Regenerate with: python3 tools/check_fonts.py --write-baseline
# Before adding a line by hand, check the slots are the same letter - a group of two
# DIFFERENT letters is the bug this check exists to catch.

